```plantuml
@startuml
title STUDY2WORK - Sequence Diagram - Đăng nhập hệ thống (Authentication Flow)

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #7A7A7A
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FAFAFA

    ParticipantBorderColor #5D5D5D
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

    ActorBorderColor #4F4F4F
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

    DatabaseBorderColor #6D6D6D
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #F8FBFF

    ControlBorderColor #4F6B8A
    ControlBackgroundColor #EEF5FC

    EntityBorderColor #5E7C5E
    EntityBackgroundColor #F4FBF4

    BoundaryBorderColor #6D5E8C
    BoundaryBackgroundColor #F8F5FF

    BoxBorderColor #CFCFCF
    BoxBackgroundColor #FCFCFC

    NoteBorderColor #C9B458
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFCE8

    ArrowColor #4A4A4A
}

actor "Người dùng" as USER

box "Frontend Layer\nFlutter / VueJS TS" #F7F9FC
boundary "Auth Screen\n(Login UI)" as UI
end box

box "API Gateway Layer" #F9FBFD
control "API Gateway" as GATEWAY
end box

box "Authentication Module" #EEF6FF
control "AuthController" as AUTH_CONTROLLER
control "Validation Layer" as VALIDATOR
control "AuthService" as AUTH_SERVICE
control "JWT Provider" as JWT_PROVIDER
control "BCrypt Security" as BCRYPT
control "Session Service" as SESSION_SERVICE
end box

box "Repository Layer" #F4FBF4
entity "UserRepository" as USER_REPO
entity "SessionRepository" as SESSION_REPO
entity "PermissionRepository" as PERMISSION_REPO
end box

box "Infrastructure Layer" #FFFDF7
collections "Redis Cache" as REDIS
database "MySQL / PostgreSQL" as DB
end box

== Người dùng nhập thông tin đăng nhập ==

USER -> UI : Nhập email + mật khẩu
activate UI

note right of UI
Input:
- email
- password

Validation UI:
- Required field
- Email format
- Password min length
end note

UI -> GATEWAY : POST /api/v1/auth/login\nContent-Type: application/json
activate GATEWAY

note right of GATEWAY
Request DTO:
{
  email: string
  password: string
}

Expected Response:
200 OK
401 UNAUTHORIZED
403 FORBIDDEN
404 NOT_FOUND
422 VALIDATION_ERROR
500 SYSTEM_ERROR
end note

GATEWAY -> AUTH_CONTROLLER : forwardRequest()
activate AUTH_CONTROLLER

== Validation Layer ==

AUTH_CONTROLLER -> VALIDATOR : validateLoginRequest(dto)
activate VALIDATOR

note right of VALIDATOR
Validation Flow:
- validate required
- validate format
- validate business rule
- validate account status
end note

alt Request không hợp lệ

    VALIDATOR --> AUTH_CONTROLLER : ValidationException
    AUTH_CONTROLLER --> GATEWAY : 422 VALIDATION_ERROR
    GATEWAY --> UI : Hiển thị lỗi validate
    UI --> USER : Thông báo lỗi dữ liệu

else Request hợp lệ

    VALIDATOR --> AUTH_CONTROLLER : validated dto

    == Business Authentication ==

    AUTH_CONTROLLER -> AUTH_SERVICE : login(dto)
    activate AUTH_SERVICE

    AUTH_SERVICE -> REDIS : GET login_block:{email}
    activate REDIS

    note right of REDIS
    Cache Purpose:
    READ login block status

    Output:
    - retry_count
    - blocked_until
    end note

    REDIS --> AUTH_SERVICE : cache result
    deactivate REDIS

    alt Tài khoản đang bị khóa tạm thời

        AUTH_SERVICE --> AUTH_CONTROLLER : BusinessException(BLOCKED_ACCOUNT)
        AUTH_CONTROLLER --> GATEWAY : 403 FORBIDDEN
        GATEWAY --> UI : Tài khoản tạm khóa
        UI --> USER : Hiển thị thời gian thử lại

    else Được phép đăng nhập

        == Truy vấn người dùng ==

        AUTH_SERVICE -> USER_REPO : findByEmail(email)
        activate USER_REPO

        note right of USER_REPO
        Repository Method:
        findByEmail(email)

        Input:
        - email:string

        Output:
        - UserEntity?
        end note

        USER_REPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
        activate DB

        note right of DB
        DATABASE ACTION:
        READ users

        Query Purpose:
        - tìm tài khoản đăng nhập

        Input:
        - email

        Returned Fields:
        - user_id
        - email
        - password_hash
        - status
        - role_id
        - failed_login_count
        - last_login_at
        end note

        DB --> USER_REPO : user record
        deactivate DB

        USER_REPO --> AUTH_SERVICE : UserEntity
        deactivate USER_REPO

        alt Không tìm thấy tài khoản

            AUTH_SERVICE --> AUTH_CONTROLLER : NotFoundException(USER_NOT_FOUND)
            AUTH_CONTROLLER --> GATEWAY : 404 NOT_FOUND
            GATEWAY --> UI : Tài khoản không tồn tại
            UI --> USER : Hiển thị lỗi

        else Tài khoản tồn tại

            == Kiểm tra trạng thái tài khoản ==

            alt status != ACTIVE

                AUTH_SERVICE --> AUTH_CONTROLLER : ForbiddenException(INACTIVE_ACCOUNT)
                AUTH_CONTROLLER --> GATEWAY : 403 FORBIDDEN
                GATEWAY --> UI : Tài khoản bị vô hiệu hóa
                UI --> USER : Hiển thị lỗi

            else Tài khoản hợp lệ

                == Verify Password ==

                AUTH_SERVICE -> BCRYPT : verify(password, password_hash)
                activate BCRYPT

                note right of BCRYPT
                Security Flow:
                - BCrypt Verify
                - Salt compare
                - Timing attack protection
                end note

                BCRYPT --> AUTH_SERVICE : true / false
                deactivate BCRYPT

                alt Sai mật khẩu

                    AUTH_SERVICE -> USER_REPO : increaseFailedLogin(user_id)
                    activate USER_REPO

                    USER_REPO -> DB : UPDATE users
                    activate DB

                    note right of DB
                    DATABASE ACTION:
                    WRITE users

                    Updated Fields:
                    - failed_login_count
                    - updated_at

                    Purpose:
                    - tăng số lần login thất bại
                    end note

                    DB --> USER_REPO : update success
                    deactivate DB

                    USER_REPO --> AUTH_SERVICE : success
                    deactivate USER_REPO

                    AUTH_SERVICE -> REDIS : SET login_retry:{email}
                    activate REDIS

                    note right of REDIS
                    Cache:
                    - failed retry counter
                    - expire: 15 minutes
                    end note

                    REDIS --> AUTH_SERVICE : OK
                    deactivate REDIS

                    AUTH_SERVICE --> AUTH_CONTROLLER : UnauthorizedException(INVALID_PASSWORD)
                    AUTH_CONTROLLER --> GATEWAY : 401 UNAUTHORIZED
                    GATEWAY --> UI : Sai mật khẩu
                    UI --> USER : Hiển thị lỗi

                else Đăng nhập thành công

                    == Transaction Begin ==

                    group BEGIN TRANSACTION

                        AUTH_SERVICE -> SESSION_SERVICE : createSession(user)
                        activate SESSION_SERVICE

                        SESSION_SERVICE -> SESSION_REPO : createSession(sessionData)
                        activate SESSION_REPO

                        note right of SESSION_REPO
                        Repository Method:
                        createSession(data)

                        Output:
                        - session_id
                        end note

                        SESSION_REPO -> DB : INSERT INTO user_sessions
                        activate DB

                        note right of DB
                        DATABASE ACTION:
                        WRITE user_sessions

                        Insert Fields:
                        - session_id
                        - user_id
                        - refresh_token
                        - ip_address
                        - user_agent
                        - expired_at

                        Returned:
                        - session_id
                        - created_at
                        end note

                        DB --> SESSION_REPO : session_id
                        deactivate DB

                        SESSION_REPO --> SESSION_SERVICE : session entity
                        deactivate SESSION_REPO

                        SESSION_SERVICE --> AUTH_SERVICE : session info
                        deactivate SESSION_SERVICE

                        == Generate JWT Token ==

                        AUTH_SERVICE -> JWT_PROVIDER : generateAccessToken(user)
                        activate JWT_PROVIDER

                        note right of JWT_PROVIDER
                        JWT Payload:
                        - user_id
                        - email
                        - role
                        - permissions

                        Expire:
                        - access_token: 2h
                        - refresh_token: 7d
                        end note

                        JWT_PROVIDER --> AUTH_SERVICE : accessToken
                        deactivate JWT_PROVIDER

                        == Load Permission ==

                        AUTH_SERVICE -> PERMISSION_REPO : getPermissionsByRole(role_id)
                        activate PERMISSION_REPO

                        PERMISSION_REPO -> DB : SELECT permissions
                        activate DB

                        note right of DB
                        DATABASE ACTION:
                        READ roles_permissions

                        Purpose:
                        - load RBAC permission
                        end note

                        DB --> PERMISSION_REPO : permissions[]
                        deactivate DB

                        PERMISSION_REPO --> AUTH_SERVICE : permissions
                        deactivate PERMISSION_REPO

                        == Update Last Login ==

                        AUTH_SERVICE -> USER_REPO : updateLastLogin(user_id)
                        activate USER_REPO

                        USER_REPO -> DB : UPDATE users
                        activate DB

                        note right of DB
                        DATABASE ACTION:
                        WRITE users

                        Updated Fields:
                        - last_login_at
                        - last_login_ip
                        - failed_login_count = 0
                        end note

                        DB --> USER_REPO : success
                        deactivate DB

                        USER_REPO --> AUTH_SERVICE : OK
                        deactivate USER_REPO

                        == Save Token Cache ==

                        AUTH_SERVICE -> REDIS : SET auth_session:{user_id}
                        activate REDIS

                        note right of REDIS
                        Cache Content:
                        - access token
                        - refresh token
                        - permission cache

                        Expire:
                        - 2 hours
                        end note

                        REDIS --> AUTH_SERVICE : OK
                        deactivate REDIS

                    end

                    == Commit Transaction ==

                    AUTH_SERVICE --> AUTH_CONTROLLER : LoginSuccessResponseDTO
                    deactivate AUTH_SERVICE

                    note right of AUTH_CONTROLLER
                    Response DTO:
                    {
                      access_token,
                      refresh_token,
                      expired_at,
                      user_profile,
                      permissions
                    }
                    end note

                    AUTH_CONTROLLER --> GATEWAY : 200 OK
                    deactivate AUTH_CONTROLLER

                    GATEWAY --> UI : Login Success
                    deactivate GATEWAY

                    UI --> USER : Điều hướng vào Dashboard
                    deactivate UI

                end
            end
        end
    end
end

== Exception Handling ==

group SYSTEM EXCEPTION FLOW

    AUTH_SERVICE -> AUTH_SERVICE : catch(SystemException)

    note right of AUTH_SERVICE
    Rollback Conditions:
    - DB insert failed
    - Redis failed
    - Token generation failed

    Action:
    - rollback transaction
    - write audit log
    - monitoring alert
    end note

end

@enduml
```
